#################################################################
# bcinr Chess Factory — RESULTS GRAPH (receipt-cited Crown proof table).
#
# DO NOT hand-edit: emitted in-process by `bcinr_benchmark` (emit_results_ttl)
# from the empirical benchmark artifacts. `ggen sync` imports this graph and
# renders artifacts/proof_table.{md,json}. Every cf:ResultCell carries the
# blake3 receipt hash that proves it. Not-installed engines and unmeasured
# cells are NEVER faked — they carry no cf:ResultCell.
#################################################################

cf:Crown_Run a cf:ResultRun ;
